cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Historical benchmark: llama.cpp speculative decoding for
  Qwen3.6-35B-A3B UD-Q4_K_XL on one RTX 3090
message: >-
  If you cite this dataset, state which release you are citing. Releases
  v1.0 through v3.0 contain claims retracted by the 2026-08-25 audit; see
  ERRATA.md.
type: dataset
authors:
