abstract: >-
  Archived single-request decode microbenchmarks of llama.cpp speculative
  decoding for Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL on one RTX 3090, collected between
  2026-04-21 and 2026-05-07 at llama.cpp commits 97895129e, bcb5eeb64, and
  PR-branch 67cb0d507. The repository preserves per-request timings, raw
  logs, and an audit (ERRATA.md) documenting which of the originally
  published claims survive re-examination and which do not.
